\n│   │   └── models/                      # Row/DB models\n│   ├── clickhousecredentialsdao/        # ClickHouse tenant credentials\n│   ├── tenantdao/                       # Tenant data access\n├── client/             # External clients (ClickHouse, MySQL, Athena, S3)\n├── config/             # Application configuration\n├── constant/           # Shared constants\n├── dto/                # Shared DTOs\n├── error/              # ServiceError enum\n├── errorgrouping/      # Symbolication and error grouping\n├── guice/              # Guice injector setup\n├── healthcheck/        # Health check endpoints\n├── model/              # Shared domain models\n├── module/             # Guice modules (*Module.java)\n├── rest/               # Response wrappers, error handling\n├── util/               # Utilities\n├── verticle/           # Vert.x verticles (MainVerticle, RestVerticle)\n└── vertx/              # Vert.x helpers\n```\n\n**Caveats on structure:**\n- `service/<domain>/impl/` is used for complex domains (interaction, configs). Simpler services may keep `*ServiceImpl` at the domain level (e.g., `service/query/QueryServiceImpl.java`).\n- `validators/` exists only where complex validation is needed (currently `resources/interaction/validators/`).\n- Query classes are usually `Queries.java`, but some domains use `*Query.java` or `*Queries.java` (e.g., `AlertsQuery.java`, `AthenaJobQueries.java`).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_0121vkZkj9fwGRm9nJpdvNWt","duration_ms":47}
