       ;;\n        ui|pulse-ui)\n            SERVICES+=(\"$CONTAINER_UI\")\n            shift\n            ;;\n        server|pulse-server)\n            SERVICES+=(\"$CONTAINER_SERVER\")\n            shift\n            ;;\n        ai|pulse-ai|pulse-ai-agent)\n            SERVICES+=(\"$CONTAINER_AI\")\n            shift\n            ;;\n        cron|alerts-cron|pulse-alerts-cron)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KBMyDWMxpAioGafuLKe2NP","duration_ms":35}
[2026-05-09 17:21:43] {"session_id":"377b805d-d994-4672-9ea1-7cda9c5c4af6","transcript_path":"/Users/sarabjyotsingh/.claude/projects/-Users-sarabjyotsingh-IdeaProjects-pulse/377b805d-d994-4672-9ea1-7cda9c5c4af6.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/sarabjyotsingh/IdeaProjects/pulse","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"xhigh"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cat /Users/sarabjyotsingh/IdeaProjects/pulse/.cursor/rules/pulse-architecture.mdc 2>&1 | head -80","description":"Inspect pulse-architecture.mdc"},"tool_response":{"stdout":"---\ndescription: Pulse platform architecture overview — always loaded for system-wide context\nalwaysApply: true\n---\n\n# Pulse Architecture\n\nPulse is a real-time observability platform for mobile apps, built on OpenTelemetry.\n\n## Monorepo Layout\n\n| Directory | Service | Tech | Port |\n|-----------|---------|------|------|\n| `backend/server/` | REST API | Java 17, Vert.x 4.5, Guice, Maven | 8080 |\n| `backend/pulse-alerts-cron/` | Alert evaluation cron + daily batch jobs | Java/Vert.x | 4000 |\n| `backend/ingestion/` | OTEL Collector configs + ClickHouse schema | YAML/SQL | — |\n| `backend/session-capture-service/` | Session replay HTTP ingest (Rust) | Rust | 3400 |\n| `backend/session-replay-ingestion/` | Kafka → S3 + ClickHouse consumer | Node.js | — |\n| `backend/heatmap-screenshot-ingestion/` | Heatmap screenshots (Kafka → S3); optional external Redis quota/dedupe | Node.js | — |\n| `pulse-ui/` | Dashboard | React 18, TypeScript, Mantine v7 | 3000 |\n| `pulse_ai/` | AI agent (`deploy` service `pulse-ai-agent` by default; standalone compose for AI-only dev) | Python, Google ADK + Gemini | 8000 |\n| `pulse-android-otel/` | Android SDK | Kotlin, OpenTelemetry | — |\n| `pulse-ios-otel/` | iOS SDK (PulseKit) | Swift, OpenTelemetry | — |\n| `pulse-react-native-otel/` | React Native SDK | TypeScript | — |\n| `deploy/` | Docker Compose, scripts, Terraform | — | — |\n| `deploy/observability-otel-prometheus-tempo/` | Optional OTEL → Prometheus + Tempo + Grafana (dev); not part of default stack | Compose | see folder `README.md` |\n\n## Data Flow\n\n```\nMobile SDKs → OTEL Collector (4317/4318) → ClickHouse (otel DB)\nOptional: pulse-server / pulse-alerts-cron (env `PULSE_BACKEND_OTEL_ENABLED`) → OTLP on host (e.g. 14318) → optional `observability-otel-prometheus-tempo` stack → Tempo / Prometheus (do not bind 14317/14318 alongside Vector on the same host without changing ports)\nMobile SDKs → Session capture API (:3400) → Kafka → Session replay ingestion → MinIO (S3) + ClickHouse\nCustom Events → Vector (14317/14318) → S3 (Parquet) → Athena / BigQuery  [Vector optional: service is commented out in `deploy/docker-compose.yml` by default; uncomment + VECTOR_ENABLED=true]\nSession replay / heatmap → Kafka → pulse-heatmap-screenshot-ingestion → S3 bucket `heatmap-assets` (keys under `heatmap-screenshots/`); optional external Redis for quota / dedupe\npulse-alerts-cron → pulse-server internal JWT routes → Redis materialization for Kong (API key map, per-project usage credits); ClickHouse for monthly usage is queried by pulse-server, not by cron\n```\n\n## Databases\n\n- **MySQL 8** (`pulse_db`): metadata — interactions, alerts, configs, symbol files, athena jobs, analytics_jobs\n- **ClickHouse 24.8** (`otel`): analytics — `otel_traces`, `otel_logs`, OTLP metrics (`otel_metrics_gauge`, `otel_metrics_sum`, `otel_metrics_summary`, `otel_metrics_histogram`, `otel_metrics_exp_histogram`, unified read view `otel_metrics`), `stack_trace_events`, `project_monthly_usage` (+ MVs), `root_cause_cache` (RCA cache; column `ProjectId`), `interaction_heatmaps_daily` (heatmap table + MV defined in `backend/db/prod/clickhouse/otel.interaction_heatmaps_daily.sql`)\n\n## Auth\n\n**Production:** Google OAuth 2.0 → JWT (access 24h, refresh 30d). Tokens in cookies on frontend.\n\n**Dev Mode** (when `GOOGLE_OAUTH_ENABLED=false`):\n- Bypasses Google OAuth\n- Mock users: `mock-user-1`, `mock-user-2` (pre-seeded in MySQL + OpenFGA)\n- Default project: `default-project` with hardcoded API key (`DEV_MODE_API_KEY`)\n- Auto-initialized on startup via `DevModeInitService`\n\n## Cross-Cutting Concerns\n\nAlert metrics span: MySQL schema → backend `ServiceError`/service/DAO → alerts cron → UI form → AI metric registry. Changes usually need updates across multiple services.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N4gpChEUPMRziawB9k9LSE","duration_ms":31}
